"Everly Kim is a petite A-rank Adjuster in Alden Thorn's CNH hero class."
"She wears her hair dyed silvery gray in two buns."
"Her spell Glaze Object coats a target in ice, and a skill lets her feet grip ice."
"She started going out with Kon at his party."
"In hero PE she is in Alden's struggles-to-deal-damage group."
"With a reagent powder she can freeze a twenty-yard patch of superslick ice."
"She speaks Korean and dislikes Lute."
